          "label": "T-S K15.5, v, left [\"Col. I\" per Cohen]",
          "value": "<p></p>\n\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">List of the Poor of old Cairo,</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">may God in his mercy make them rich</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">and help them in his grace and kindness</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
